                             Table "public.reviews"
   Column    |  Type   | Collation | Nullable |             Default              
-------------+---------+-----------+----------+----------------------------------
 review_id   | integer |           | not null | generated by default as identity
 book_id     | integer |           | not null | 
 customer_id | integer |           | not null | 
 order_id    | integer |           |          | 
 rating      | integer |           | not null | 
 comment     | text    |           |          | 
 review_date | date    |           | not null | 
Indexes:
    "reviews_pkey" PRIMARY KEY, btree (review_id)
    "reviews_book_id_customer_id_key" UNIQUE CONSTRAINT, btree (book_id, customer_id)
Check constraints:
    "reviews_rating_check" CHECK (rating >= 1 AND rating <= 5)
Foreign-key constraints:
    "reviews_book_id_fkey" FOREIGN KEY (book_id) REFERENCES books(book_id)
    "reviews_customer_id_fkey" FOREIGN KEY (customer_id) REFERENCES customers(customer_id)
    "reviews_order_id_fkey" FOREIGN KEY (order_id) REFERENCES orders(order_id)
[exit 0]